  "description": "NetToolsKit.AspNetCore.OpenApi unifies OpenAPI conventions and helpers across Swagger (Swashbuckle) and Scalar renderers.\n\n\t\t\tFeatures:\n\t\t\t• Document/operation/schema transformers (sorting, metadata, enum handling).\n\t\t\t• Typed options for .NET 9 OpenAPI with safe .NET 8 fallback.\n\t\t\t• Consistent UI and metadata configuration via extensions.\n\n\t\t\tIdeal for teams standardizing OpenAPI output across multiple ASP.NET Core services.",
